## Migration database
dotnet ef migrations add InitialCreate --project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Infrastructure\ --startup-project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Api\
dotnet ef database update --project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Infrastructure\ --startup-project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Api\

## Run Api Project
dotnet watch --project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Api\
dotnet run --project .\<%= it.ProjectName %>.Api\
